772
02:07:54,627 --> 02:07:57,287
What does paraphrasing mean?

773
02:07:57,707 --> 02:08:01,587
It means expressing the same message in different words.

774
02:08:02,648 --> 02:08:07,707
Okay, or we can say rewarding for the purpose of clarification.

775
02:08:08,427 --> 02:08:12,228
You tell about the same thing with other words.

776
02:08:12,228 --> 02:08:15,847
