786
02:09:08,148 --> 02:09:12,127
Of course, in the text, we sometimes ask you the meaning of a word.

787
02:09:12,127 --> 02:09:15,487
It might not be only a single word.

788
02:09:15,567 --> 02:09:20,167
It might be a phrase consisting of more than one word.

789
02:09:22,607 --> 02:09:26,627
We can ask you the synonym or the antonym.

790
02:09:26,747 --> 02:09:28,427
Antonym is the opposite of the word.

791
02:09:29,627 --> 02:09:29,927
Okay.

792
02:09:30,347 --> 02:09:33,627
And the contextual meaning of the word holds more importance here.

793
02:09:33,787 --> 02:09:35,007
Okay, so this is very important.

794
02:09:35,007 --> 02:09:37,268
Contextual meaning of the word means.

795
02:09:37,268 --> 02:09:42,807
What does that word mean in that context, in the text?

796
02:09:43,287 --> 02:09:46,247
