818
02:11:23,475 --> 02:11:27,355
And the last two of them are the reference questions.

819
02:11:28,795 --> 02:11:34,395
These reference questions ask about the meanings of pronouns and demonstratives in the text,

820
02:11:34,435 --> 02:11:38,555
such as they, he, she, it, which, who, that, this, etc.

821
02:11:38,555 --> 02:11:44,915
We ask you these, what these words refer to.

822
02:11:44,915 --> 02:11:57,275
Okay, refer to, it shows that it has a specific meaning in the text and we want you to find it.

823
02:11:57,815 --> 02:12:00,115
The goal of these questions is simple.

824
02:12:00,815 --> 02:12:04,275
You need to decide what the pronoun or phrase refers to.

825
02:12:04,415 --> 02:12:06,975
And the question types are usually like this.

826
02:12:08,335 --> 02:12:10,295
What does it refer to?

827
02:12:11,135 --> 02:12:13,655
